#[chapter/09/lore]{
  notes: [
    "Nine honks are nine sampled tropes: the Fool's set has sounded eight — three-wishes, trickster-in-the-tree, genie-in-the-bottle, vizier-at-court, two-receipts, labyrinth-city, sworn-oath,..."
    "The ninth honk was never sounded. Its shard is the egg: an unspent wish is an unsounded note."
    "Assembled, the set is a shape with one hole, egg-sized — the whole serial arranged around a held breath."
  ]
}

